{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01950","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 水溢芙蓉沼 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 水溢芙蓉沼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渌沼春光後，青青草色浓。\n绮罗惊翡翠，暗粉妒芙蓉。\n云遍窗前见，荷翻镜里逢。\n将心托流水，终日渺无从。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}